# Machines watched by Fleetwatch, one per line:
#
#   <label>  <ssh target>  [<hostname>]
#
# The target is whatever you would type after `ssh`: a Host from ~/.ssh/config,
# user@address, or an address. The line whose hostname matches the machine
# you are on (or whose target is "local") runs locally, so the same file can be
# copied to every machine in the list.
#
# For example:
#
#   desktop    desktop.lan      desktop
#   homeserver me@192.0.2.10    homeserver
